      "widgets_values": [
        "ln-vox — narration mode, stage by stage.\n\n1. Set book_id / title on the Book node.\n2. EPUB source? Un-bypass 'Ingest EPUB (0a)' (Ctrl+B). A folder of .txt chapters under novels/<book_id>/ needs nothing.\n3. Pick the narrator by ear first (see the hand-casting example) and paste its clip id into Voice Cast.\n\nNodes cache their results: re-queueing does nothing. Bump a node's 'rerun' to run it and everything after it again."
